  "description": "Make video games history!\nStart in a tiny office in 1976, program pixelated dreams on clunky computers, and experience up close how audacious ideas become legendary blockbusters. Form visionary teams, survive flops and risk everything for the next big hit; the future of the industry is in your hands. Are you up to the task?\n\n• Build your studio – from a modest space to a state-of-the-art office complex with server farms and motion-capture studios\n• Recruit the best brains in the industry – hire brilliant developers, experienced producers, and talented designers\n• Revolutionize the market – design the next-gen console that will change the gaming world forever\n• Set new standards – develop groundbreaking titles that will be talked about for decades to come\n• Become an industry giant – sell licenses, buy studios and dominate the global gaming market",
